# This file is hand-written in order to ensure that mu*N and D*N are constant
# for the ions as a function of N.
#
# The following values are used:
#
# mu = 2E-4 (at 1 bar)
# D  = 5E-6 (at 1 bar)


E/N (Td)	Mobility *N (1/m/V/s)
10	4.827E21
100	4.827E21
1000	4.827E21
 

E/N (Td)	Diffusion coefficient *N (1/m/s)
10	1.206E20
100	1.206E20
1000	1.206E20
 